{"title":"1987 AIME Problems/Problem 15","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Easy_Trig_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Easy Trig Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Messy_Trig_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Messy Trig Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4_(Algebra)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4 (Algebra)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Squares <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/0/b10d5ee88ffc7d59f9c282b366953fb4fa4051f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/4/7f4caea56d945d0b6e49701b42ce06e0fb92e663.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"17\" height=\"15\" /> are <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Inscribe\" title=\"Inscribe\">inscribed</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Right_triangle\" title=\"Right triangle\">right triangle</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" />, as shown in the figures below. Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/5/df5d74c0e1426dbc050db5c243e16a6f7051f704.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC + CB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"78\" height=\"14\" /> if area <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/d/f0d0a7cc8dbe1c52f448d11d9cc209dfc27a2f7c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(S_1) = 441$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"83\" height=\"18\" /> and area <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/8/1f83fef4235cdce0bb2fd7428e95b7589b30f6c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(S_2) = 440$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"83\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AIME_1987_Problem_15.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/6/61/AIME_1987_Problem_15.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"365\" height=\"80\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:1987_AIME-15a.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/1/1d/1987_AIME-15a.png/360px-1987_AIME-15a.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"360\" height=\"80\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/1/1d/1987_AIME-15a.png/540px-1987_AIME-15a.png 1.5x, https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/1/1d/1987_AIME-15a.png/720px-1987_AIME-15a.png 2x\" /></a></span>\n</p><p>Because all the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Triangle\" title=\"Triangle\">triangles</a> in the figure are <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Similar\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Similar\">similar</a> to triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" />, it's a good idea to use <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Area_ratios\" title=\"Area ratios\">area ratios</a>. In the diagram above, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/d/73dc604647371029075aaa0bf4315c73b325e46a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac {T_1}{T_3} = \\frac {T_2}{T_4} = \\frac {441}{440}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"127\" height=\"40\" /> Hence, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/7/537f815611afcdfe969056afafc56e3546fbab14.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$T_3 = \\frac {440}{441}T_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"89\" height=\"38\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/e/dee5ee7cbd446a457f8eb9373c944addde6daef2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$T_4 = \\frac {440}{441}T_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"90\" height=\"38\" />. Additionally, the area of triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> is equal to both <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/4/5b439093bc74a720f744a1863011ecc1c9a5d6e9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$T_1 + T_2 + 441$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"106\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/2/f528524ac7466344695b4b855679927b77107f69.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$T_3 + T_4 + T_5 + 440.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"151\" height=\"15\" /> \n</p><p>Setting the equations equal and solving for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/d/35d4698fff01484f830b3a88bd694e16f24bbfd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$T_5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/9/4599ca9e25df3950fde629a5a02f9ae1d3d5252f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$T_5 = 1 + T_1 - T_3 + T_2 - T_4 = 1 + \\frac {T_1}{441} + \\frac {T_2}{441}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"351\" height=\"38\" />. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/f/adff2c8f8b830fd4bd3e24591cdb24c3c5c4499a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$441T_5 = 441 + T_1 + T_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"179\" height=\"17\" />. However, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/5/d25303502c83ef5983b99509453c2cfd0f996937.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$441 + T_1 + T_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"106\" height=\"15\" /> is equal to the area of triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" />! This means that the ratio between the areas <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/d/35d4698fff01484f830b3a88bd694e16f24bbfd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$T_5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/c/e8c6659f50a5772f1f9ea59fb561e96d38c6b9d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$441$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" />, and the ratio between the sides is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/b/44bf7920ca8cf0f9cba7133733eba8fa70f7d69c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt {441} = 21$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"83\" height=\"18\" />. As a result, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/6/656fa9ef1cf4963a7fb422cb1e77ddd98d0dcba0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB = 21\\sqrt {440} = \\sqrt {AC^2 + BC^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"247\" height=\"19\" />. We now need <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/3/cf3a882815eba984e227b4eadd896a4eae6dea04.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(AC)(BC)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"83\" height=\"18\" /> to find the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/0/c207378deeb804b205bf84d65dc26d4141cb70e7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC + BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"79\" height=\"14\" />, because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/f/eaf830d4eec548044e46e64eaaf75ef9f6718d58.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC^2 + BC^2 + 2(AC)(BC) = (AC + BC)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"337\" height=\"21\" />.\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/8/8189a5b5a0917b8c93350827be4038af1839139d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> denote the height to the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Hypotenuse\" title=\"Hypotenuse\">hypotenuse</a> of triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" />. Notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/1/11144ce674e414870cb4747b78e87232abf6f94e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h - \\frac {1}{21}h = \\sqrt {440}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"132\" height=\"37\" />. (The height of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> decreased by the corresponding height of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/d/35d4698fff01484f830b3a88bd694e16f24bbfd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$T_5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"15\" />) Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/c/a7c10d50662fc9ed844a514cbfbbf8b4c5b733c8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(AB)(h) = (AC)(BC) = 22\\cdot 21^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"260\" height=\"21\" />. Because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/f/d9f7b60a9b96d7accdb547d0db3209293dfcf892.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC^2 + BC^2 +  2(AC)(BC) = (AC + BC)^2 = 21^2\\cdot22^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"422\" height=\"19\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/7/407c39975d6d3385586a7d270ad3a26d23e86df1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC + BC = (21)(22) = \\boxed{462}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"231\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Easy_Trig_Solution\">Easy Trig Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Easy Trig Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/4/8042017bf42531cece647ce046f6cb043c5fb195.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tan\\angle ABC = x$\" width=\"119\" height=\"13\" />. Now using the 1st square, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/6/946e6755d6cb6b3ebda76aa07f9627681b0af12e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC=21(1+x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"124\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/d/35dab642900dae2125e34167c4ffd4c310613905.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CB=21(1+x^{-1})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"143\" height=\"19\" />. Using the second square, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/1741ebf10bb8d428092127a0a9b7a5a9758ae1f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB=\\sqrt{440}(1+x+x^{-1})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"199\" height=\"21\" />. We have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/e/4beb330229807dc462c7838ec9e842ae9c5ac179.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC^2+CB^2=AB^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"152\" height=\"16\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/f/5dfaa54500d33df79590938c9216add0bdaf8e9c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[441(x^2+x^{-2}+2x+2x^{-1}+2)=440(x^2+x^{-2}+2x+2x^{-1}+3).\\]\" width=\"477\" height=\"19\" /> Rearranging and letting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/2/4b27d6166c899d5eef8ae6b5b939e7ec2d96710f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u=x+x^{-1} \\Rightarrow u^2 - 2 = x^2 + x^{-2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"264\" height=\"16\" /> gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/8/10808a6a5eda2b795d93695867d7aa94ee766681.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u^2+2u-440=0.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"149\" height=\"18\" /> We take the positive root, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/9/699efee73e76d4899ba5f7c4acebe55458054763.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u=20$\" width=\"52\" height=\"12\" />, which means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/9/ee90b1ef0bfb01f42a0cde1f417dd52ca8995fae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC+CB=21(2+x+x^{-1})=21(2+u)=\\boxed{462}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"389\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Messy_Trig_Solution\">Messy Trig Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Messy Trig Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/e/52e8ed7a3ba22130ad3984eb2cd413406475a689.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\theta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> be the smaller angle in the triangle. Then the sum of shorter and longer leg is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/3/7e3dee0f26a5054fe80ebe54a84543c8845a6de2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{441}(2+\\tan{\\theta}+\\cot{\\theta})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"183\" height=\"21\" />. We observe that the short leg has length <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/4/54472750ddad37b99c894252027b1a7bab642064.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{441}(1+\\tan{\\theta}) = \\sqrt{440}(\\sec{\\theta}+\\sin{\\theta})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"297\" height=\"21\" />. Grouping and squaring, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/c/d4cbae6d4f9c5fad3f6d855f9714d30c8443ecf4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{\\frac{440}{441}} = \\frac{\\sin{\\theta}+\\cos{\\theta}}{1+\\sin{\\theta}\\cos{\\theta}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"181\" height=\"43\" />. Squaring and using the double angle identity for sine, we get, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/c/f5c411ef88e7cf765f8f34485eb036ad521b2d29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$110(\\sin{2\\theta})^2 + \\sin{2\\theta} - 1 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"222\" height=\"19\" />. Solving, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/e/20e5cd60dd6849586ac18258d473d2ceb5263579.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin{2\\theta} = \\frac{1}{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"88\" height=\"37\" />. Now to find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/a/e4ab2f9357f67da1f9352644730edfed7e23471b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tan{\\theta}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"40\" height=\"14\" />, we find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/4/13404ffc5c317889f69dbe8ca491cc4b8fc73e7d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos{2\\theta}$\" width=\"45\" height=\"13\" /> using the Pythagorean\nIdentity, and then use the tangent double angle identity. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/2/0c2f78c9b66db285413a9da8f94a1d9a40bed253.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tan{\\theta} = 10-3\\sqrt{11}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"145\" height=\"18\" />. Substituting into the original sum,\nwe get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/7/6c720f5973f9f5bc6390d30f8a9959efbd9f4852.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{462}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"39\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_4_.28Algebra.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4_(Algebra)\">Solution 4 (Algebra)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4 (Algebra)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/2/4429300bb60a1a8d2dc0d905616f7d3a18f3cf58.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] size(200); pair A, B, C, D, E, F; A = (0, 5); B = (12, 0); C = (0, 0); D = (0, 60/17); E = (60/17, 60/17); F = (60/17, 0); draw(A--B--C--cycle); draw(D--E--F); label(&quot;$A$&quot;,A,N); label(&quot;$B$&quot;,B,dir(0)); label(&quot;$C$&quot;,C,SW); label(&quot;$D$&quot;,D,W); label(&quot;$E$&quot;,E,NE); label(&quot;$F$&quot;,F,S); label(&quot;$S_1$&quot;,(30/17,30/17)); [/asy]\" width=\"335\" height=\"165\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/b/bbb3f5cd62d761e088f4f0d1c88b7e71d3e0a651.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] size(200); pair A, B, C, W, X, Y, Z; A = (0, 5); B = (12, 0); C = (0, 0); real m = 1.31004366812; real n = 3.1441048035; W = (0,m); X = (m,m+n); Y = (m+n,n); Z = (n,0); draw(A--B--C--cycle); draw(W--X--Y--Z--cycle); label(&quot;$A$&quot;,A,N); label(&quot;$B$&quot;,B,dir(0)); label(&quot;$C$&quot;,C,SW); label(&quot;$W$&quot;,W,dir(180)); label(&quot;$X$&quot;,X,NE); label(&quot;$Y$&quot;,Y,NE); label(&quot;$Z$&quot;,Z,S); label(&quot;$S_2$&quot;,(2.22707423581,2.22707423581)); [/asy]\" width=\"335\" height=\"162\" />\n</p><p>Label points as above. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/8/ec8d645ebd540b126f57b198e0708cb9669ca87d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=AC$\" width=\"62\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/b/57bdba861d114867901fd4ba164c7c2e59294c40.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"65\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/2/fe250ee1defe8bf26272f7f8a39821dd61d4bb04.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_1 = 21$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"60\" height=\"17\" /> be the side length of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/0/b10d5ee88ffc7d59f9c282b366953fb4fa4051f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"15\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/0/d603fb89756379e72e4a15e14eeb75e014e08a87.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_2 = \\sqrt{440}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"84\" height=\"22\" /> be the side length of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/4/7f4caea56d945d0b6e49701b42ce06e0fb92e663.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"17\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/3/7134f6de65417c53ae344074214eeefb00102a3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC\\sim\\triangle AED$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"145\" height=\"18\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/3/683039a8451af456923d0a8f2d59165205117f19.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x}{y} = \\frac{x-s_1}{s_1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"93\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/3/e83b0fae53051608b172621b3b687df6f38d7b3f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\implies xs_1=xy-ys_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"165\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/8/f68ba491a52ff78ea52d425a58fdf269da6f0ca0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\implies xy=s_1(x+y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"163\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/e/a6e27bd9623fc7fe0bea9b7477e3406bee8b674c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\implies xy=21(x+y) \\qquad \\qquad (*)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"255\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/e/54e669a7d1445ddf745ced2cc52c741aab99052e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC\\sim\\triangle AWX\\sim\\triangle ZBY$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"234\" height=\"18\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/1/0417940b4614e537fff2b05255e4f96848e8442d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_2 + \\frac{s_2x}{y} + \\frac{s_2y}{x}=\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"221\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/9/ce937b9960e0f7b61b443b62e0280c7ec9ec3d05.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\implies s_2(x^2+xy+y^2)=xy\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"295\" height=\"24\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/e/fee946187a7b46f9e9a8d7453c9643d2456f353b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\implies s_2^2(x^2+xy+y^2)^2 = x^2y^2(x^2+y^2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"313\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/a/26a46056463e749879fd5e9c2bc4013714e79cba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\implies 440(x^2+xy+y^2)^2 = x^2y^2(x^2+y^2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"325\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/b/5cb4bf2e56d66c6fc5da3de6a9611610ddbd05ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t=x+y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"72\" height=\"15\" />. Repeatedly applying <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/0/9d02e715e7f7195675151570530c5b62ba7b2744.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(*)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" />, we get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/1/f6110cd79958770ff3726f43646d08c4319f7025.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[440(t^2-21t)^2 = 441t^2(t^2 - 42t)\\]\" width=\"248\" height=\"20\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/c/d0c8e02153042da80ceaf38a859372bb69ed9d47.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[440(t-21)^2 = 441(t^2-42t)\\]\" width=\"220\" height=\"20\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/a/a4a6c117fe3f2fdee448d617ea7280b32006e113.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[440t^2 - 42\\cdot 440t + 440\\cdot 441 = 441t^2 - 441\\cdot 42t\\]\" width=\"370\" height=\"17\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/8/7288bd2d14141729e8d1e07c1d08a590a4a813a6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[t^2-42t-440\\cdot 441=0\\]\" width=\"183\" height=\"15\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/a/95a297c2247941bf5a6c3918a4090326cdc4ebd5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(t-21)^2 = 441^2\\]\" width=\"124\" height=\"20\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/7/47724ea4d4a9a1fd96882e241f64b38bd6f2549b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[t-21=441\\]\" width=\"97\" height=\"12\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/d/ccdda78a239243d601133ef4d0902ae46fe59d03.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[t=\\boxed{462}\\]\" width=\"69\" height=\"23\" />\n</p><p>~rayfish\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME\" title=\"1987 AIME\">1987 AIME </a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Problems\" title=\"1987 AIME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1987 AIME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=1987\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1987 AIME Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b>Last<br />Question</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1987 AIME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1987 AIME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1987 AIME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1987 AIME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1987 AIME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1987 AIME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1987 AIME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1987 AIME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1987 AIME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1987 AIME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1987 AIME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1987 AIME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1987 AIME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1987 AIME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017180203\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.068 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.114 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 492/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1743/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 102/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 16134/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,temp